{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026v8mP9h7XRr1795007961.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>冬日小鎮尖沙咀光影匯演今晚啟動，尖沙咀太空館、鐘樓及藝術館等地標，呈現多媒體光影表演。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.WINTERFEST_008.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262jh9bfosmF1795007972.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.WINTERFEST_012.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BW1YYgT7Mt1795008043.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>太空館外牆化作巨型雪花水晶球與光影屏幕，配合聖誕燈光。文化中心則變成大型點唱機，播放節日歌曲。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.WINTERFEST_009.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264N2xZ64MBa1795007987.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.WINTERFEST_011.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BWVTu2iXOX1795008018.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.WINTERFEST_007.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026weON2uU9Zi1795008064.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.859303+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:57:10.584954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:59.610463+00:00","content_hash":"5a3b8a889ae0fd8605bfd4fbf1f86fa31ef43d3b1992b2e59b3ae4c5dd8fbb92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.859303+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget"